====Particle====
{{en-head|pcl}}

# {{non-gloss|A particle used for marking the following verb as an [[infinitive]].}}
#: {{ux|en|I want '''to''' leave.}}
#: {{ux|en|He asked me what '''to''' do.}}
#: {{ux|en|I have places '''to''' go and people '''to''' see.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''To''' err is human.}}
#: {{ux|en|Who am I '''to''' criticise? I've done worse things myself.}}
#: {{ux|en|Precisely '''to''' get away from you was why I did what I did.}}
#: {{ux|en|I need some more books '''to''' read and friends '''to''' go partying with.}}
#: {{ux|en|Those '''to''' avoid death [[ended up]] being exiled.}}
#: {{ux|en|He fled to India, never '''to''' return.}}
#: {{ux|en|I woke up '''to''' find my name plastered on every [[front page]].}}
#: {{ux|en|If he lets you down, he'll have me '''to''' [[reckon with]].}}
#* {{RQ:Pope Essay on Criticism|text='''To''' err, is human; '''to''' forgive, divine.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Hamlet|3|1|text='''To''' be, or not '''to''' be: that is the question: / {{...}}}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2010|month=July|journal=[[w:Associated Press|Associated Press]]|section=headline|url=http://www.google.com/hostednews/ap/article/ALeqM5gfMucgz8wUGUNUNXRyIyqzY6lWwQD9GM98N83|passage=Odds are, BP '''to''' get new CEO this year|title=Archived copy|accessdate=9 March 2019|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20100705003703/http://www.google.com/hostednews/ap/article/ALeqM5gfMucgz8wUGUNUNXRyIyqzY6lWwQD9GM98N83|archivedate=5 July 2010}}
#* {{quote-journal
