|text=I started out by wrapping the first thread around a ruler for 1 inch and found that it had 24 wraps '''to''' the inch.}}
# {{non-gloss|Used to describe what something consists of or contains.}}
#: {{ux|en|Anyone could do this job; there's nothing '''to''' it.}}
#: {{ux|en|There's a lot of sense '''to''' what he says.}}
#: {{ux|en|The name has a nice ring '''to''' it.}}
#: {{ux|en|There are 100 pence '''to''' the pound.}}
# {{n-g|Denotes the end of a range.}}
#: {{ux|en|It takes 2 '''to''' 4 weeks to process typical applications.}}
