=====Usage notes=====
{{m|nb|to|To}} has the same form with nouns of all genders: ''to biler'' ("two cars"), ''to bøker'' ("two books"), ''to hus'' ("two houses"). It may also stand without an expressed noun, as in ''de to'' ("the two of them").

