#: {{uxa|pl|A '''to''' zdolniacha z wuja!|Uncle '''really''' is gifted!}}
#: {{uxa|pl|No, '''tośmy''' wczoraj mieli niezły bal!|Well, we had '''quite''' a party yesterday!}}
# {{lb|pl|literary}} {{ng|used to indicate that the topic refers to a known object, mentioned in the preceding statement}}
